      "basis": "HS models Fielddeck work power as supply_voltage_v x (Pi + keyboard + fan current) + display power with supply_voltage_v = 5 V (design.json engineering_assumptions), and runtime as usable bank energy / work power. pi_work_current_a is the only HS-adjustable input with room to move runtime (keyboard_current_a is 0.1 A with a 0.02 A floor); bank capacity is fixed in the design and is not an HS revision input. The minimum is HS's registered lower bound for pi_work_current_a.",
